@startuml
' bt-view-kind: context
' bt-view-id: world-engine:system-context
title World Engine - System Context
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

' bt-element-id: player
' bt-element-id: backend
' bt-element-id: world
' bt-element-id: ai
' bt-element-id: content

actor "Player\nResponsibility: Submit semantic intent and observe committed narrative\nContract: Ticket-bound session\n[[../../../../world-engine/world_engine/api/story_ws.py source]]" as player
rectangle "Backend\nResponsibility: Authenticate and proxy play operations\nContract: Signed internal request\n[[../../../../backend/app/services/game/game_service.py source]]" as backend
rectangle "World Engine\nResponsibility: Own sessions, validate proposals and commit story truth\nContract: HTTP/WebSocket story API\n[[../../../../world-engine/world_engine/main.py source]]" as world
rectangle "AI Stack\nResponsibility: Produce bounded narrative proposals\nContract: Proposal and evidence, never commit\n[[../../../../ai_stack/langgraph/langgraph_runtime_executor.py source]]" as ai
rectangle "Content Authority\nResponsibility: Supply versioned authored facts and policy\nContract: Immutable bound content version\n[[../../../../content/modules/god_of_carnage/module.yaml source]]" as content

player ..> backend : "submits intent\ncontract: authenticated player request\n[[../../../../backend/app/api/v1/game_routes_impl.py source]]"
backend ..> world : "proxies turn\ncontract: signed story request\n[[../../../../backend/app/services/game/game_service.py source]]"
content ..> world : "supplies authored truth\ncontract: bound immutable content version\n[[../../../../world-engine/world_engine/content/backend_loader.py source]]"
world ..> ai : "requests proposal\ncontract: bounded context and trace\n[[../../../../world-engine/world_engine/story_runtime/governed_runtime_adapters.py source]]"

legend bottom
Viewpoint: context
Concern: Live authority among player, backend, content and AI proposal collaborators
Elements expose responsibility, contract and source anchor.
Edges name the interaction or dependency contract.
endlegend
@enduml
